gs2compiler provides CMake targets:

    find_package(gs2compiler CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE gs2compiler::gs2compiler)

The target is a NativeAOT shared library. Its Release build is used by all
CMake configurations.

The compiler source is fetched from
https://github.com/Preagonal/Preagonal.Scripting.GS2Compiler at the commit pinned
by REF in portfile.cmake. A local dependencies/gs2compiler checkout is not needed.
Publishing requires the .NET 10 SDK and the NativeAOT prerequisites for the target.

To update the compiler, change REF to the published commit, increment port-version
in vcpkg.json, and regenerate CMake.
